is God your Lord: all control belongs to Him. Those you invoke beside Him do not even control the skin of a date stone;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُولِجُ","en_gloss":"He causes to enter","transliteration":"yūliju","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in (to)","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"the day","transliteration":"l-nahāri","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيُولِجُ","en_gloss":"and He causes to enter","transliteration":"wayūliju","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","en_gloss":"the day","transliteration":"l-nahāra","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in (to)","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَسَخَّرَ","en_gloss":"and He has subjected","transliteration":"wasakhara","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","en_gloss":"the sun","transliteration":"l-shamsa","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ","en_gloss":"and the moon","transliteration":"wal-qamara","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُلٌّۭ","en_gloss":"each","transliteration":"kullun","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَجْرِى","en_gloss":"running","transliteration":"yajrī","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِأَجَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a term","transliteration":"li-ajalin","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۚ","en_gloss":"appointed","transliteration":"musamman","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","en_gloss":"That (is)","transliteration":"dhālikumu","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":18,"ar":"رَبُّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَهُ","en_gloss":"for Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"35:13"},{"pos"